{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Smol Kobold Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smol Kobold Garden is a cozy yet deep creature raising game where you collect, breed, and train adorable little kobolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ever Changing Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape your dream garden by changing the terrain and ecosystem to attract new creatures and uncover hidden species.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Raise and Breed</strong> unique kobolds with different colors, shapes, patterns and personality traits.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Good or Evil?</strong> The way you care influences your kobolds attitude and how they grow over time!</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mini-games and Competitions.</strong> Earn items, medals, and upgrades in a variety of smaller games.</li></ul><br>Will you create the ultimate life form? Start your garden today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2361070?t=1744652612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2361070?t=1744652612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361070/be098182eef485b1d2e30493598c71f4dc0c86fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744652612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361070/be098182eef485b1d2e30493598c71f4dc0c86fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744652612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Smol Kobold Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smol Kobold Garden is a cozy yet deep creature raising game where you collect, breed, and train adorable little kobolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ever Changing Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape your dream garden by changing the terrain and ecosystem to attract new creatures and uncover hidden species.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Raise and Breed</strong> unique kobolds with different colors, shapes, patterns and personality traits.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Good or Evil?</strong> The way you care influences your kobolds attitude and how they grow over time!</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mini-games and Competitions.</strong> Earn items, medals, and upgrades in a variety of smaller games.</li></ul><br>Will you create the ultimate life form? Start your garden today!</p>","developers":["uwusoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361070/c8ac3b84606ff48c2da4d73df273c75ab075f07f/header.jpg?t=1744652612","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2017-2025 uwusoft LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121705,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121705/movie480.mp4?t=1743673175","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121705/movie_max.mp4?t=1743673175"},"name":"Smol Kobold Garden Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121705/eeeb990e743e5322ea683481b6444bca85cce199/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743673175","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121705/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743673175","max":"http://video